ketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8CombQLBa0Q7kNvwG3RFXh&_nc_oc=Adofll2J1P89I-mIslsMmb-czWvOJxOO6KsMSql71p9XNmDFxsAKpQ0p-X0izhIm8rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ7bJoLzGi_ZiUsIL8bjRr0_pAPGFevzU280mg2cf3rlA&oe=6B05C0DC"}, {"file_name": "GlobalLeaderboards_Image.png", "id": "556916340796636", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618051_556916344129969_4630520520253278561_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MIFGGepr1o8Q7kNvwFRAkCp&_nc_oc=Ado6GEi30WD8QKtb3vN2K5J541pP_Yy3HUfV1mjXlJZyWGxI7dPHHPQNx4hm0XMHLlY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnkjdSdooivR0-QZRpQfyjUwuqW5kBwb96lboSfzk_6A&oe=6B05CA20"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image.png", "id": "1238200904331680", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301526_1238200907665013_4439728854047711627_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jbtHxmqssJsQ7kNvwE4r5vu&_nc_oc=AdrSoEAcsAmoHWQSeFrjnXQR56aprt6XGq22UlRhUm8xDV4rfbM9ADrJR_doJ-CNFXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRgHl-Y8WwsTQ9wtqUFxC0LFDQNl5a4L9rdcNXX9qGxbw&oe=6B05BFEB"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image.png", "id": "1366120307973125", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300977_1366120311306458_2475007633126940757_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e1EYMSb0lZAQ7kNvwFnW-ib&_nc_oc=AdpAVJTU8R38gK29aVksLnol4Mxjhv_QhMcmqK59KyUnsv4mYDuOs7jtJ3-nwfQqHG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTckRmbmhqRKfxc3q1PoFVz_Y7VD3o8VShPdHzXhObyaQ&oe=6B05B7BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Do you like to punch things?!\nPunch Bomb is an intense action arcade game where you punch things designed from the ground up for those who like a challenge!\n\nThis game **IS NOT EASY**\n\nClimb the global leaderboards in 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n# Classic Mode\n\n\n\nSurvive for as long as you can while punching a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, racking up huge combos, hitting targets, and dodging dangerous laser obstacles!\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRegular bombs no longer explode in this mode, and targets extend your time. Go ballistic to try to get as high of a score as possible within the time limit!\n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of small challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock a variety of unique cosmetics by **PLAYING THE GAME** if you're up for a good challenge! Each with their own unique particle effect!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Do you like to punch things?! Punching bombs away from you before they explode while dodging dangerous laser obstacles and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "publisher_name": "Chris Folea Makes Things", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.punchbomb.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": 